HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The sseettkkeeyy utility first appeared in WIDE Hydrangea IPv6 protocol stack
     kit.  The utility was completely re-designed in June 1998.  It first ap‐
     peared in FreeBSD 4.0.

BBUUGGSS
     The sseettkkeeyy utility should report and handle syntax errors better.

     For IPsec gateway configuration, _s_r_c___r_a_n_g_e and _d_s_t___r_a_n_g_e with TCP/UDP
     port number do not work, as the gateway does not reassemble packets (can‐
     not inspect upper-layer headers).

